<speak>Good afternoon, Mr Tan. Adeline Lim here. Thank you for setting aside the time for our call. Are you somewhere comfortable to speak? We have allowed a longer slot today, so there is no need to squeeze everything into a few minutes. I have my notes ready, and we can leave the routine administrative matters until whichever point suits the conversation. If anyone comes into your office or you need to attend to something, just let me know and we can pause. I would rather you not have to juggle the telephone and your staff at the same time.</speak>